<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kamla Persad-Bissessar</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">born 1952</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kamla Persad-Bissessar is a Trinidadian lawyer and politician who became the first woman prime minister of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/trinidad">Trinidad</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tobago">Tobago</a> in 2010, at the head of the People's Partnership coalition. She served until 2015 and returned as prime minister after the 2025 election victory of the United National Congress, which she has led since 2010.</p></div>
